{
    "title": "Sonny's BBQ",
    "description": "Welcome to the Sonny\u2019s BBQ App\u2014the fastest, easiest way to have everything you love about Sonny\u2019s right at your fingertips. We designed the Sonny\u2019s App just like we prepare our BBQ\u2014keeping you, our guest, in mind.\r\n\r\nEarn BBQ Rewards\r\nWith every order through the Sonny\u2019s BBQ App, you earn loyalty points that you can redeem for free menu items. The more you enjoy our slow-smoked BBQ, the quicker you'll earn rewards. Celebrate your love for Sonny\u2019s by earning points towards exclusive perks.\r\n\r\nEasy Ordering Anytime, Anywhere\r\nSkip the line and get your favorite BBQ delivered straight to your door or prepared for curbside pickup. The Sonny\u2019s BBQ App makes browsing the menu, customizing your order, and repeating past favorites as easy as a few taps. Whether it\u2019s for a quiet dinner at home or a big gathering, you can order the BBQ you love in seconds.\r\n\r\nSave Your Past Orders\r\nDo you have a go-to BBQ order you can\u2019t get enough of? Our app lets you save your past orders for faster ordering next time.",
